OL,3,GNEWSABereaved parents demand public
OL,4,Ainquiry into hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies whose children died while
OL,7,Funder the care of a hospital's
OL,8,Fpaediatric unit have called for a
OL,9,Fpublic inquiry.
OL,11,FAction Group: Skylark launched its
OL,12,Fcampaign calling for an inquiry into
OL,13,Fthe Skylark ward at Kettering General
OL,14,FHospital on Friday during a candlelit
OL,15,Fvigil in the town.
OL,17,FOrganiser Louise Longster's 13-year-old
OL,18,Fdaughter Chloe died in November 2022,
OL,19,Fand a coroner found her death was
OL,20,Fcontributed to by neglect. She said her
OL,21,Ffamily had been "failed" and she wanted
OL,22,Fto see independent scrutiny.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
